IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-privacy`

-- Privacy Act 1988 (Cth), ss 6C, 6D, 6EA, APP 7, ss 6N, 6Q, 20C, 20W, 20X, 21D and Part IIIC -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_privacy-act-1988.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*): Chloe, 21, applies for a credit card and a credit
-- report is pulled on 10 June 2024 (c043), and gets marketing calls and texts on 1 July 2024 (c044). Jake, 24, takes two
-- credit cards on 2 March 2031 (k048); owes $41,000 to collectors on 6 February 2037 (k064); proposes a debt agreement on 20
-- April 2037; the agreement completes on 31 May 2042 (k075). Daniel's company Jarrah, registered in March 2031, has three
-- employees on 1 June 2031 and "no Privacy Act under three million of turnover" (d044); on 3 April 2036, "now above $3 million
-- turnover", 1,200 users' email addresses are breached (d052).
-- The scenarios give no turnover figures, no default dates, no notice dates and no day on which the debt agreement was MADE;
-- the figures and dates used for them below are the encoder's, chosen to sit on the side of the line the scenario states.

`d044: Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000` MEANS Operator WITH
    `carried on the business at some time in the previous financial year` IS FALSE
    `annual turnover for the previous financial year` IS 0
    `annual turnover for the current year` IS 400000
    `highest annual turnover for any financial year ended since it started` IS 0
    `provides a health service and holds health information outside employee records` IS FALSE
    `trades in personal information without consent or legal authority` IS FALSE
    `is a contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract` IS FALSE
    `is a credit reporting body` IS FALSE
    `is a body corporate related to one with a business that is not small` IS FALSE
    `has a registered choice to be treated as an organisation` IS FALSE

