#ASSERT `the Act binds it as an organisation` `d052: Jarrah in April 2036, previous year turnover assumed 3400000`

`c044: a telemarketing call to Chloe, the Do Not Call Register Act applying` MEANS `Marketing use` WITH
    `the marketer is bound as an organisation` IS TRUE
    `the Do Not Call Register Act or Spam Act applies to it` IS TRUE
    `the information is sensitive information` IS FALSE
    `collected from the individual` IS FALSE
    `the individual would reasonably expect this use` IS FALSE
    `the individual consented` IS FALSE
    `consent was impracticable to obtain` IS FALSE
    `a simple opt-out means is provided` IS TRUE
    `each communication states the individual may opt out` IS FALSE
    `the individual has asked not to receive direct marketing` IS FALSE
    `used by a contracted service provider to meet a Commonwealth contract obligation` IS FALSE

