§ `ss 6N, 20C -- credit information`

#ASSERT `it is credit information` `personal insolvency information`
#ASSERT NOT `it is credit information` `sensitive information`
#ASSERT NOT `it is credit information` `information about income or savings`

#ASSERT `a credit reporting body may collect it from a credit provider` `a statement that an information request was made` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a credit reporting body may collect it from a credit provider` `identification information` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a credit reporting body may collect it from a credit provider` `repayment history information` FALSE TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 20V, 20W -- retention`

#ASSERT `the s 20W retention period in years` `default information` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the s 20W retention period in years` `financial hardship information` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the s 20W retention period in years` `a serious credit infringement opinion` EQUALS 7

#ASSERT NOT `s 20W fixes a retention period in years for it` `identification information`

