    `the provider believes the individual is at least 18` IS TRUE
    `the body is an agency or has an Australian link` IS TRUE
    `it relates to something before the individual turned 18` IS FALSE
    `the credit was provided or applied for in Australia` IS TRUE
    `notice of intention to disclose given` IS TRUE
    `days since that notice` IS 20

