    `made on` IS 20370420
    `how it ended` IS `ended under s 185N`
    `ended on` IS 20420531

`k075 variant: made 1 July 2037, ends under s 185N on 31 May 2042` MEANS `Debt agreement` WITH
    `made on` IS 20370701
    `how it ended` IS `ended under s 185N`
    `ended on` IS 20420531

