`d052: 1,200 email addresses taken, serious harm judged likely` MEANS `Data incident` WITH
    `the entity is an APP entity bound by APP 11.1` IS TRUE
    `what happened` IS `unauthorised access or disclosure`
    `after the loss, unauthorised access or disclosure is likely` IS FALSE
    `a reasonable person would conclude serious harm is likely` IS TRUE
    `remedial action under s 26WF took it out` IS FALSE

`d052 variant: the same, serious harm judged not likely` MEANS `Data incident` WITH
    `the entity is an APP entity bound by APP 11.1` IS TRUE
    `what happened` IS `unauthorised access or disclosure`
    `after the loss, unauthorised access or disclosure is likely` IS FALSE
    `a reasonable person would conclude serious harm is likely` IS FALSE
    `remedial action under s 26WF took it out` IS FALSE

`d052 variant: the same breach in 2031, when Jarrah was a small business operator` MEANS `Data incident` WITH
    `the entity is an APP entity bound by APP 11.1` IS FALSE
    `what happened` IS `unauthorised access or disclosure`
    `after the loss, unauthorised access or disclosure is likely` IS FALSE
    `a reasonable person would conclude serious harm is likely` IS TRUE
    `remedial action under s 26WF took it out` IS FALSE

`variant: an encrypted laptop lost, access not likely` MEANS `Data incident` WITH
    `the entity is an APP entity bound by APP 11.1` IS TRUE
    `what happened` IS `loss of the information`
    `after the loss, unauthorised access or disclosure is likely` IS FALSE
    `a reasonable person would conclude serious harm is likely` IS TRUE
    `remedial action under s 26WF took it out` IS FALSE

§ `Part IIIC`

#ASSERT `it is an eligible data breach` `d052: 1,200 email addresses taken, serious harm judged likely`
#ASSERT NOT `it is an eligible data breach` `d052 variant: the same, serious harm judged not likely`
#ASSERT NOT `it is an eligible data breach` `d052 variant: the same breach in 2031, when Jarrah was a small business operator`
#ASSERT NOT `it is an eligible data breach` `variant: an encrypted laptop lost, access not likely`

#ASSERT `an assessment under s 26WH is required` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `an assessment under s 26WH is required` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `a statement must go to the Commissioner` `d052: 1,200 email addresses taken, serious harm judged likely` TRUE

#ASSERT `the notification route` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `notify every individual whose information it was, or only those at risk`
#ASSERT `the notification route` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `publish the statement on its website and publicise it`

